      - %TC_INSTALLPATH% -> 'C:\TwinCAT\3.1\' (Windows), '/usr/local/etc/TwinCAT/3.1/' (TC/BSD), '\Hard Disk\TwinCAT\3.1\' (Windows CE) ]]></Comment><IGroup>16448</IGroup><IOffset>410958</IOffset><BitSize>2048</BitSize></Symbol><Symbol><Name>GVL_TcUnit.CurrentTestIsFinished</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Whether or not the current test being called has finished running ]]></Comment><IGroup>16448</IGroup><IOffset>411214</IOffset><BitSize>8</BitSize></Symbol><Symbol><Name>GVL_TcUnit.IgnoreCurrentTest</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ This is a flag that indicates that the current test should be ignored, and
